---
layout: base.njk
title: Work
permalink: /work/
description: Selected work by zorvan — verifiable secret sharing, side-channel analysis, client-side validation, topological tools for thought.
---
<div class="page-intro">
  <p class="kicker">Repositories</p>
  <h1>Work</h1>
  <p>Grouped by register rather than by date. Everything links to source.</p>
</div>

{%- for group in projects.groups %}
<section class="group">
  <div class="section-head">
    <span class="idx">{{ loop.index | folio }}</span>
    <h2>{{ group.title }}</h2>
  </div>
  <p class="gnote">{{ group.note }}</p>
  <div class="cards">
    {%- for item in group.items %}
    <a class="card" href="{{ item.url }}" rel="noopener">
      <div class="cname">{{ item.name }}</div>
      <p class="cdesc">{{ item.desc }}</p>
      <span class="clang">{{ item.lang }}</span>
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{%- endfor %}

<section class="group">
  <p class="muted">
    More lives at <a href="https://github.com/zorvan">github.com/zorvan</a> and
    <a href="https://github.com/diewan">github.com/diewan</a>. The 2015 origin — an
    N-Queens solver in Clojure — is kept in the <a href="/archive/">archive</a>.
  </p>
</section>
